9,5140,5141,5142,5143,5144,5145,5146,5147,5148,5149,5150,5151,5152,5153,5154,5155,5156,5157,5158,5159,5160,5161,5162,5163,5164,5165,5166,5167,5168,5169,5170,5171,5172,5173,5174,5175,5176,5177,5178,5179,5180,5181,5182,5183,5184,5185,5186,5187,5188,5189,5190,5191,5192,5193,5194,5195,5196,5197,5198,5199,5200,5201,5202,5203,5204,5205,5206,5207,5208,5209,5210,5211,5212,5213,5214,5215,5216,5217,5218,5219,5220,5221,5222,5223,5224,5225,5226,5227,5228,5229,5230,5231,5232,5233,5234,5235,5236,5237,5238,5239,5240,5241,5242,5243,5244],"projection_sha256":"742e70ba865a4d9fdfcf78fe0ed8782ca1a103a5ec6c62bdddb948e3500602ed"},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-xietiao-ws1492435"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003","text":"出爲晉安王鎮北諮議、南東海太守，行南徐州事。啟王敬則反謀，上甚賞之，遷尙書吏部郎。朓上表三讓。中書疑朓官未及讓，以問國子祭酒沈約。約曰：「宋元嘉中，范曄讓吏部，朱修之讓黃門，蔡興宗讓中書，並三表詔答。近代小官不讓，遂成恆俗，恐有乖讓意。王藍田、劉安西並貴重，初自不讓，今豈可慕此不讓邪？孫興公、孔覬並讓記室，今豈可三署皆讓邪？謝吏部今授超階，讓別有意，豈關官之大小。撝謙之美，本出人情，若大官必讓，便與詣闕章表不異。例旣如此，謂都非疑。」朓讓，優答不許。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":23,"end":26,"surface":"王敬則","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0023","person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王敬則。"},{"start":41,"end":42,"surface":"朓","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0041","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"},{"start":50,"end":51,"surface":"朓","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0050","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABCBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝朓。"},{"start":62,"end":64,"surface":"沈約","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0062","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作沈約。"},{"start":65,"end":66,"surface":"約","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p003:m0065","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","kind":"person","statu