:"s-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws-ws1997726"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001","text":"史臣曰：脩之、宗慤，皆以將帥之材，懷廉潔之操，有足稱焉。玄謨雖苛剋少恩，然觀其大節，亦足為美。當少帝失道，多所殺戮，而能冒履不測，傾心輔弼，斯可謂忘身徇國者歟。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":57,"last_line":57,"raw_start":5607,"raw_end":5687,"raw_character_offsets":[5607,5608,5609,5610,5611,5612,5613,5614,5615,5616,5617,5618,5619,5620,5621,5622,5623,5624,5625,5626,5627,5628,5629,5630,5631,5632,5633,5634,5635,5636,5637,5638,5639,5640,5641,5642,5643,5644,5645,5646,5647,5648,5649,5650,5651,5652,5653,5654,5655,5656,5657,5658,5659,5660,5661,5662,5663,5664,5665,5666,5667,5668,5669,5670,5671,5672,5673,5674,5675,5676,5677,5678,5679,5680,5681,5682,5683,5684,5685,5686],"revision_id":1997726},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"脩之","kind":"person","person_id":"j6y_10h_eso","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"宗慤","kind":"person","person_id":"af1_11d_057","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun:p001:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun","book_id":"b-songshu-076","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-076-xuanmo-shilun-ws1997726"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-xietiao-ws1492435","source":{"title":"南齊書/卷47·謝朓傳","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=南齊書/卷47&oldid=1492435","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=南齊書/卷47&oldid=1492435","revision_id":1492435,"accessed_on":"2026-11-20","raw_path":"source-evidence/nanshi019-xietiao/nanqishu047-ws1492435.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"89b06ce5c95f39f241acb1a475dd94c220a958f567a7003fd358666f9747df2e","extent":"卷47第58行謝朓題下，至第75行共評題前。"